Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted).
Upstream status: not submitted.
libcdio uses Perl only for documentation and regression tests and installs
no Perl script, so it needs Perl as a build tool, not a runtime dependency.
perl:run is also refused in cross builds.

--- a/misc/libcdio/Makefile
